Spec: Maintenance Layer
Purpose: Provide administrative, diagnostic, and key-rotation utilities for the system.

Platform: Go/Linux

Structure:
  ./mitm_adm-data-debug/
  ./mitm_key_rotation/
  ./mitm_maintenance_cleanup/
  ./mitm_maintenance_config/

Owns:
  ./**

Must:
  Operate as standalone, demand-driven CLI tools or cron jobs, independent of the scheduler.
  Connect directly to the database or utilize system APIs when permitted.
